# Graphify × Fast CLI (gated)

**Gate:** If `graphify-out/graph.json` is missing → normal `rg`/`fd`/`ast-grep` only. Do not call graphify, MCP graph tools, or `/graphify`.

When the gate passes:

```text
L0 MCP (only if tools exist) → L1 graphify query|path|explain --budget 1500
→ L2 scoped rg/fd/ast-grep → L3 edit → L4 graphify update . (once per edit batch)
```

- Cursor often has no graphify MCP → default L1; never retry-loop missing tools.
- L4 once at end of a coherent edit batch (not after every file). Skip if graph was absent.
- Never run full multimodal `/graphify .` unless the user asks.
- Prefer scoped subgraph / wiki over `GRAPH_REPORT.md` or multi-file reads.
